    [
     1,
     "Hi, I tried this:\r<br>  y1 ~ normal(y1_pred, sigma_y);\r<br>in which y1 was a matrix, y1_pred was a matrix, and sigma_y is a scalar.  But it did not work.  Is that right?\r<br>A\r<br>\r<br>\r<br>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "ZqjbEnrhkaIJ",
   "from": "Daniel Lee",
